<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Ranch to issue 600 mln bht bond.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Ranch to issue 600 mln bht bond.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai poultry processing company, Bangkok Ranch Plc, said on Friday it will issue 5-year unsecured debentures worth 600 million baht ($23.1 million) through a private placement.</p>
<p>The proceeds from the debentures will be used to expand Bangkok Ranch's farms and plants in the region, the company said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>Other details and conditions of the debentures will be finalised by its board later, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
